  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 5840,
      "text": "Autonomous underwater vehicle, or AUV."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 5840,
      "endMs": 10800,
      "text": "It actually resembles a miniature aeroplane that moves deep in the ocean."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 10800,
      "endMs": 15760,
      "text": "It's not large enough to have a human crew aboard, and so its behavior is really that"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 15760,
      "endMs": 17120,
      "text": "of a robot."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 17120,
      "endMs": 22840,
      "text": "The AUV is programmed to calculate and record a range of data, depending on the mission"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 22840,
      "endMs": 26040,
      "text": "it is carrying out at any one time."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 26040,
      "endMs": 31300,
      "text": "In previous missions, it has been programmed to record water pressure, as well as how much"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 31300,
      "endMs": 33640,
      "text": "salt there is in the water."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 33640,
      "endMs": 38800,
      "text": "On a more recent mission around Bermuda, an AUV was equipped with a special instrument"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 38800,
      "endMs": 42680,
      "text": "that showed the temperature of the ocean at different depths."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 42680,
      "endMs": 46240,
      "text": "It can also assess the quality of the water in general."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 46240,
      "endMs": 52360,
      "text": "So as you see, it is quite a versatile and useful little piece of equipment."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 52360,
      "endMs": 58040,
      "text": "We use its measurements to determine and increase our understanding of ocean behaviors,"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 58040,
      "endMs": 62280,
      "text": "as well as its role in and influence on our climate."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 62280,
      "endMs": 65360,
      "text": "This instrument also has many other benefits."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 65360,
      "endMs": 68480,
      "text": "It can be launched and used relatively quickly."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 68480,
      "endMs": 73040,
      "text": "Also, there is no need for cables to physically link it to a boat."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 73040,
      "endMs": 75040,
      "text": "There are disadvantages, though."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 75040,
      "endMs": 81080,
      "text": "AUVs move at only modest speeds up to 25 centimeters per second."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 81080,
      "endMs": 86960,
      "text": "In addition, the AUV structure cannot collect water samples, so other equipment must be"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 86960,
      "endMs": 90720,
      "text": "used to conduct a chemical analysis of the water."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 90720,
      "endMs": 95040,
      "text": "Now I'm sure you're all wondering how the AUV actually works."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 95040,
      "endMs": 99480,
      "text": "First, let's see how an AUV actually moves."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 99480,
      "endMs": 103680,
      "text": "Well, it moves by pumping oil between two bladders."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 103680,
      "endMs": 106640,
      "text": "This helps the AUV to sink or float."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 106640,
      "endMs": 112120,
      "text": "The AUV records the data and measurements that it has been programmed to take while it"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 112120,
      "endMs": 114600,
      "text": "rises to the surface."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 114600,
      "endMs": 120560,
      "text": "At the beginning and end of each dive, it obtains records and transmits its position by exposing"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 120560,
      "endMs": 124880,
      "text": "an antenna embedded within the tip of the right wing."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 124880,
      "endMs": 125880,
      "text": "Okay?"
    }
  ],
